  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nConsider A and B as '×'\n\nConsider C as '-'\n\nSo,\n\n15 A 6 B 2 C 10 = 170 ⇒ 15 × 6 × 2 - 10 = 170\n\n⇒ __**15 × 6 × 2**__ - 10 = 170\n\n⇒ __**180 - 10**__ = 170\n\n⇒ 170 = 170 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n8 A 5 B 4 C 50 = 110 ⇒ 8 × 5 × 4 - 50 = 110\n\n⇒ __**8 × 5 × 4**__ - 50 = 110\n\n⇒ __**160 - 50**__ = 110\n\n⇒ 110 = 110 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n 4 A 2 B 3 C 5 = ? ⇒ 4 × 2 × 3 - 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**4 × 2 × 3**__ - 5 = ?\n\n⇒ __**24 - 5**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **19 = ?**\n\nHence,** \"Option 1\"** is the correct answer.",
